post Saved from b:
  a heard Saved from b
  any heard Saved from b
post Saved from a, with userInfo:
  a heard Saved from a v=7
  b heard Saved from a v=7
  any heard Saved from a v=7
post Closed, no sender:
  any heard Closed from -
remove a for Saved; post Saved:
  b heard Saved from a
  any heard Saved from a
observers: 2
b goes away; post Saved from a:
  any heard Saved from a
observers: 1
any adds an observer while hearing; post Ping twice:
  any heard Ping from -
  (added late)
  any heard Ping from -
  late heard Ping from -
remove any and the late one; post Ping:
observers: 0
shared is shared: 1
a heard 2, any heard 7
